Content-Type: text/plain; charset="us-ascii"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable

All,

The AVK Series 66 Valve (gate valves with PE ends) meets the requirements o=
f the Buy America Act for country of origin to be USA.

The valves are made in Minden, NV.

You can expect that CMF consultants may try to require gate valves to be ma=
de in the USA.  Of course that will run counter to CMF peddling a Korean ma=
de PE Ball Valve.

J



